		{
			description: [
				"This chapter covers all the odds and ends!"
				""
				"If it's made for Create and makes your life easier (or weirder), it’s probably in here."
				""
				"From Mob Spawners to Mechanical Extruders, from Slicers to "
				"Teleporters - get ready to dive into the extras."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
