		{
			dependencies: ["610FD2C783821A4E"]
			description: [
				"Create Mechanical Extruder is introduced as a post-End addon in Create - Forge Frontier."
				""
				"To craft a Mechanical Extruder, you'll first need to produce a Stargaze Singularity Casing."
				""
				"{\"text\":\"You can learn more about crafting the Stargaze Singularity \",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"here!\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"78FDFDDD273A975C\"},\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true}]}"
				""
				"Learn more about using your Mechanical Extruder on the next page!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You've made it, now how do you use it?"
				""
				"First, place the proper vent/block underneath the Extruder and add a bucket of proper fluid (refer to JEI) to both sides of the Extruder. Then, power it from the back with rotational power. You can pull the items from it using belts and funnels, or even AE2."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "6B0EFB5F45658146"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "45AB2351B2E8ED0B"
					item: "create_dd:shadow_steel"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
