			x: -4.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["610FD2C783821A4E"]
			description: [
				"The Mechanical Chicken is a machine that can be used to automate eggs! "
				""
				"To use it, feed Seed Oil into the fluid pipe on the Mechanical Chicken, and then power it via the shaft located on the bottom. "
				""
				"The Mechanical Chicken will produce 1 egg for every 100mb of Seed Oil!"
				""
				"The eggs must be removed through a Funnel or an Item Pipe."
				""
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mechanical_chicken.png width:200 height:122 align:center}"
