			description: [
				"The Sprinkler is more than just a fancy way to water crops."
				""
				"Fill it with water to keep farmland moist automatically."
				""
				"Insert lava to burn nearby mobs-or yourself."
				""
				"Feed it liquid fertilizer to accelerate crop growth."
