		{
			dependencies: ["610FD2C783821A4E"]
			description: [
				"The Soul Catcher lets you capture mobs for transport and use in the Create Mechanical Spawner."
				""
				"First, weaken the mob with a Potion of Weakness, then right-click it to trap its soul inside the device."
				""
				"You can even capture Boss Mobs, if they are not blacklisted. You must reduce their health to 95% and then throw the potion and capture them."
				""
				"{\"text\":\"Then, place the Soul Catcher inside a \",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Mechanical Spawner\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2DC29EE22186BDB7\"},\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true},{\"text\":\"-it's the first step toward fully automating mob farms with Create.\"}]}"
			]
