		{
			dependencies: ["1E7318B244F927D2"]
			description: [
				"The Mechanical Spawner lets you generate mobs on demand using SU and a bit of fluid automation."
				""
				"Insert a Soul Catcher to define which mob will be spawned. It requires a minimum of 128 RPM to function and consumes 50 mB of Builder’s Tea per mob spawned."
				""
				"The Builder’s Tea must be piped into the pipe face on the side of the spawner. It also includes a configurable spawning area-adjusted by right clicking the spawner-to control where mobs spawn."
				""
				"With the right setup, you can create efficient, automated mob farms-no natural spawning needed."
			]
			icon: "create_mob_spawners:mechanical_spawner"
			id: "2DC29EE22186BDB7"
