			description: [
				"The Brass Jetpack trades a bit of speed for greater vertical range."
				""
				"It is fueled by lava and water, refilled using Tanks or Buckets, to create steam for propulsion. "
				""
				"Can reach up to 30 blocks high."
				""
				"Slightly slower than the Mithril Jetpack, but perfect for vertical mobility."
				""
