		{
			dependencies: ["610FD2C783821A4E"]
			description: [
				"The &bCopper Tap&r allows for easy filling of &aBasins&r and can also perform &eSpout&r recipes on a &7Depot&r placed directly below it."
				""
				"The &bCentrifugal Pump&r is an upgraded, more powerful version of Create’s &fMechanical Pump&r that is highly configurable. Consult the &ePonder&r for detailed information on its setup and operation."
				""
				"Lastly, the &bHoneycomb Mold&r is a handy quality-of-life item that lets you compress liquid honey into &6solid Honeycombs&r, making honey processing simpler and cleaner."
