		{
			dependencies: ["610FD2C783821A4E"]
			description: [
				"&lResource vents&r is more than just a feature-it's a revolution in resource automation. This innovative system introduces a renewable method for generating the rare &oore stones&r of the &3Create&r mod, giving you the tools to industrialize your resource pipeline like never before."
				""
				"While the base mod focuses on &oBasic Ore Stones&r, this expanded integration unlocks &ohigh-tier Resource vents&r-letting you automate everything from &7Tin&r to &dCalorite&r. Whether you’re building megastructures or refining rare alloys, &lResource vents are the key to sustainable progress&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Biome and Dimension Specificity"
				"Each molten vent is tightly bound to the environment-&oVeridium&r blooms in deserts, &oGlacium&r chills in frozen peaks, and &oAncient Debris&r erupts from the Nether roof. Your challenge is to scour the world for these elemental veins of power."
				""
				" Activation Ritual"
				"Once found, transform a dormant vent into an active one feeding a &4blaze burner&r a &cblaze cake&r directly atop it. When the tranformation is complete, feed it its unique liquid fuel-be it a milkshake or molten blend-and watch as it begins converting &oessence into ore&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Helpful Tools and Features"
				""
				"Portable Vents – Thanks to custom changes in this pack, you can mine active vents to move them wherever your factory automation requires them."
				""
				"Mechanical Extruders – Designed for late-game automation, these machines pull &oorestones&r from a single fluid source block, removing the need for complex setups."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"With Resource vents, your world becomes a living forge-&lwhere lava flows into iron, milkshakes into gold, and ambition into industry&r."
				""
				" &oThe stone beneath your feet is no longer a limit-it’s a launchpad. Ready to reshape your world?&r"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "create_resource_vents:active_asurine_vent"
			id: "7AC47553B491EE76"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "044F3A7E366EB2DB"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 25
				}
				{
					id: "3B12084B5C15151A"
					item: "create:mechanical_drill"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "Resource vents: A New Era of Resource Generation, Click me for more info!"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "77168E2D646C1F11"
					item: "minecraft:copper_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "1897B3BF3A210851"
					item: "minecraft:iron_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "50CB0982BC4BF504"
					item: "create:zinc_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Create Resource Vents"
			x: -7.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["610FD2C783821A4E"]
			description: [
				"Create Metallurgy is a mod that allows you to process metals more efficiently."
				""
				"You will need to crush ores and wash them to get the most out of your ore."
				""
				"Every ore dust, when dirty, will produce a &6byproduct&r when washed, giving you bonus materials for your efforts."
				""
				"Before you can begin melting, you’ll need to mix up some &eRefractory Mortar&r, an essential material used to craft the Foundry Basin and begin the first stage of metal processing."
				""
				"This washed dust can then be melted and cast using molds or the casting basin."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This system also introduces &6molten metal alloying&r, letting you combine different materials into powerful new alloys like steel, obdurium, and brass."
				""
				"As you progress further, you’ll unlock advanced tools such as the &bBelt Grinder&r for efficient polishing."
				""
				"You will also unlock the &cIndustrial Crucible&r, which is capable of forming a massive, automated melting setup for large-scale metal production."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "createmetallurgy:foundry_mixer"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "33664D1FB2DB41D1"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "45C513351607616D"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "create:andesite_alloy_block"
						tag: { }
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "1218DCEBD33D6AE2"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 50
				}
			]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "Molten Metal Mastery."
			tasks: [{
				id: "38793FCFB80C1C6D"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "createmetallurgy:refractory_mortar"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Welcome to Create Metallurgy"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33664D1FB2DB41D1"]
			description: [
				"Using your newly obtained &eRefractory Mortar&r, craft a &bFoundry Lid&r and &bFoundry Basin&r."
				""
				"Once you craft them, you are ready to begin melting your ores."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To begin, place the Foundry Basin atop a &cBlaze Burner&r, and place a Foundry Lid on top of that. You can use a &aMechanical Arm&r, &7pipes&r, or &eBelts&r to insert ores into the Foundry Basin."
				""
				"Once the Basin is heated and the Lid is closed by &oshift right-clicking&r, it will begin melting the ore. The molten metal can then be extracted using &7pipes&r or a &bMechanical Pipette&r."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &bCasting Table&r and &bCasting Basin&r serve as the two primary ways to turn your molten ore into usable materials such as &eingots&r, &7plates&r, &6blocks&r, or &bwires&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To automate the process, use &bCreate Fluid Pipes&r together with a &bMechanical Pump&r to control the exact flow of molten metal into your molds."
				""
				"&7Pretty Pipes&r does not work as intended for this purpose, so you must use &fvanilla Create pipes&r, or later on, &bApplied Energistics 2&r for full automation."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You can also use the &bMechanical Pipette&r to automate the process. Learn more about how to use it in its "
				"{\"text\":\"dedicated quest.\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"08BCFA45FB71AB42\"},\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/metallurgy_setup.png width:180 height:140 align:center}"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "createmetallurgy:foundry_basin"
				tag: { }
			}
